<title>USA: Core Inc plans acquisition.</title>
<headline>Core Inc plans acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Core Inc Wednesday announced its intent to acquire the assets of Protocol Work Systems Inc, a Massachusetts based firm specializing in job analysis and loss prevention.</p>
<p>Financial details were undisclosed. The closing is scheduled to occur shortly.</p>
</text>
